"use strict";(self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs=self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs||[]).push([[8245],{77912(t,e,i){i.r(e),i.d(e,{comp:()=>f,data:()=>m});var a=i(20641);const o=i.p+"assets/img/product-notification.e2c07f18.webp",n=i.p+"assets/img/admin-notifications.a52bb828.webp",r=i.p+"assets/img/admin-notifications-types.a52bb828.webp",s=i.p+"assets/img/admin-notifications-orders.ee4500fd.png",d=i.p+"assets/img/admin-notifications-orders-processing.72eeded5.png",l=i.p+"assets/img/admin-notifications-orders-completed.dfb38b45.png",c=i.p+"assets/img/admin-notifications-product-tab.79bcfa58.png",g=i.p+"assets/img/admin-notifications-vendor-tab.7c2fff26.png",p={},f=(0,i(66262).A)(p,[["render",function(t,e){return(0,a.uX)(),(0,a.CE)("div",null,e[0]||(e[0]=[(0,a.Fv)('<h1 id="admin-notifications" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#admin-notifications"><span>Admin Notifications</span></a></h1><p>The <strong>Admin Notifications</strong> feature keeps the admin informed about important marketplace activities in real time.</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/product-notification.webp"><img src="'+o+'" alt="Admin Notifications"></a></p><hr><h2 id="admin-access-navigation" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#admin-access-navigation"><span>Admin Access &amp; Navigation</span></a></h2><p>Marketplace administrators can access the centralized notification hub directly from the WordPress administrative dashboard:</p><ol><li>Log in to the WordPress admin panel as an administrator.</li><li>In the left navigation menu, navigate to <strong>Marketplace &gt; Notifications</strong>.</li><li><strong>Direct Admin URL</strong>:<div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="text"><pre><code><span class="line">wp-admin/admin.php?page=wk-marketplace-notifications</span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div></li></ol><hr><h2 id="admin-notification-overview" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#admin-notification-overview"><span>Admin Notification Overview</span></a></h2><ul><li>Admin receives notifications for key marketplace actions, including: <ul><li>New orders</li><li>Order status changes</li><li>Product creation or updates</li><li>Product approval requests</li><li>Vendor-related activities</li></ul></li></ul><hr><h2 id="notification-area" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#notification-area"><span>Notification Area</span></a></h2><ul><li>All notifications are displayed in the <strong>admin notification area</strong>.</li><li>Notifications help the admin take quick actions without navigating through multiple sections.</li></ul><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-notifications.webp"><img src="'+n+'" alt="Admin Notifications"></a></p><h3 id="administrative-interface-structure" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#administrative-interface-structure"><span>Administrative Interface Structure</span></a></h3><p>The Admin Notifications interface consists of three primary functional zones:</p><ol><li><strong>Top Header &amp; Tab Bar</strong>: Displays the notification bell icon, page title, and primary navigation buttons (<strong>Orders</strong>, <strong>Product</strong>, <strong>Vendor</strong>).</li><li><strong>Sub-Navigation Filter Bar</strong> <em>(Orders Tab)</em>: A sub-filter bar (<code>subsubsub</code>) that isolates orders by lifecycle state (<strong>All</strong>, <strong>Processing</strong>, <strong>Completed</strong>).</li><li><strong>Notification Activity Feed</strong>: An ordered list (<code>.mp-notification-list</code>) displaying each notification item with hyperlinks, contextual descriptions, and relative time counters.</li><li><strong>Pagination Navigation Bar</strong>: A standard pagination bar (<code>.mp-notification-pagination</code>) allowing store administrators to page through older records.</li></ol><hr><h2 id="types-of-notifications" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#types-of-notifications"><span>Types of Notifications</span></a></h2><p>The admin can view notifications related to:</p><ul><li><strong>Products</strong><ul><li>New product added by vendor</li><li>Product awaiting approval</li></ul></li><li><strong>Orders</strong><ul><li>New order placed</li><li>Order status updated</li></ul></li><li><strong>Vendors</strong><ul><li>Vendor registration</li><li>Vendor-related updates</li></ul></li></ul><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-notifications-types.webp"><img src="'+r+'" alt="Admin Notifications Types"></a></p><hr><h2 id="tab-1-orders-notifications-tab-orders" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#tab-1-orders-notifications-tab-orders"><span>Tab 1: Orders Notifications (<code>tab=orders</code>)</span></a></h2><p>The <strong>Orders</strong> tab is the default landing screen of the Admin Notifications module (<code>page=wk-marketplace-notifications</code>). It records every vital order-related transaction across the marketplace.</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-notifications-orders.png"><img src="'+s+'" alt="Admin Notifications - Orders Tab Dashboard"></a></p><h3 id="sub-filter-sections" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#sub-filter-sections"><span>Sub-Filter Sections</span></a></h3><p>The Orders tab provides sub-filters to narrow down high-volume order feeds:</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Filter Name</th><th style="text-align:left;">Query Parameter</th><th style="text-align:left;">What It Displays</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>All</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>section=all</code> <em>(Default)</em></td><td style="text-align:left;">Displays all order events in reverse chronological order, including new order placements, status changes to processing, completion events, and refund updates.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Processing</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>section=processing</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Filters the feed exclusively for orders whose status transitioned to <strong>Processing</strong> (e.g., successful payment received).</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Completed</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>section=completed</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Filters the feed exclusively for orders whose status transitioned to <strong>Completed</strong> (e.g., packages dispatched or fulfilled).</td></tr></tbody></table><h4 id="processing-section-view" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#processing-section-view"><span>Processing Section View</span></a></h4><p>When clicking <strong>Processing</strong>, the system filters the table to show orders requiring fulfillment or currently in preparation:</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-notifications-orders-processing.png"><img src="'+d+'" alt="Admin Notifications - Orders Processing Filter"></a></p><h4 id="completed-section-view" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#completed-section-view"><span>Completed Section View</span></a></h4><p>When clicking <strong>Completed</strong>, the admin can review all orders that reached terminal fulfillment:</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-notifications-orders-completed.png"><img src="'+l+'" alt="Admin Notifications - Orders Completed Filter"></a></p><h3 id="order-notification-message-formats" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#order-notification-message-formats"><span>Order Notification Message Formats</span></a></h3><p>Each order notification row contains structured information:</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Notification Trigger</th><th style="text-align:left;">Event Text Format</th><th style="text-align:left;">Target URL / Drilldown</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>New Customer Order</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>#&lt;Order_ID&gt; Order has been placed by &lt;Customer_Name&gt; &lt;X&gt; days ago.</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Opens the WooCommerce Order Edit screen (<code>wp-admin/post.php?post=&lt;ID&gt;&amp;action=edit</code> or HPOS equivalent) in a new browser tab.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Status to Processing</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>#&lt;Order_ID&gt; Order status has been changed to Processing &lt;X&gt; days ago.</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Opens the WooCommerce Order Edit screen in a new browser tab.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Status to Completed</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>#&lt;Order_ID&gt; Order status has been changed to Completed &lt;X&gt; days ago.</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Opens the WooCommerce Order Edit screen in a new browser tab.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Order Refunded</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>#&lt;Order_ID&gt; Order status has been changed to Refunded &lt;X&gt; days ago.</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Opens the WooCommerce Order Edit screen in a new browser tab.</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="tab-2-product-notifications-tab-product" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#tab-2-product-notifications-tab-product"><span>Tab 2: Product Notifications (<code>tab=product</code>)</span></a></h2><p>The <strong>Product</strong> tab tracks inventory milestones, catalog approvals, and product updates submitted by marketplace vendors.</p><p><strong>Direct URL</strong>: <code>wp-admin/admin.php?page=wk-marketplace-notifications&amp;tab=product</code></p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-notifications-product-tab.png"><img src="'+c+'" alt="Admin Notifications - Product Tab Dashboard"></a></p><h3 id="product-notification-formats" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#product-notification-formats"><span>Product Notification Formats</span></a></h3><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Notification Type</th><th style="text-align:left;">Trigger Event</th><th style="text-align:left;">Display Format</th><th style="text-align:left;">Admin Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Product Approval</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Vendor product status transitions from pending/draft to published</td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>#&lt;Product_Title&gt; has been approved &lt;X&gt; days ago.</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Clicking <code>#&lt;Product_Title&gt;</code> opens the WooCommerce Product editor in a new tab.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Product Rejection</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Admin rejects a vendor&#39;s submitted product</td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>#&lt;Product_Title&gt; has been rejected by the admin. Open the product to see the reason.</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Informs admin and vendor of the rejection event.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Deleted Product Fallback</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Product was approved but later permanently deleted from WooCommerce</td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>#(deleted-item) has been approved &lt;X&gt; days ago.</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Safely displays historical record without broken links (links to <code>#</code>).</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Low Stock Alert</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Product inventory falls below the WooCommerce low stock threshold</td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>Product is low in stock. There are &lt;Qty&gt; left &lt;X&gt; days ago.</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Alerts admin to restock or remind vendor to update quantity.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Out of Stock Alert</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Product inventory drops to zero</td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>Product is out of stock &lt;X&gt; days ago.</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Immediate notice to prevent unfulfillable backorders.</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="tab-3-vendor-notifications-tab-seller" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#tab-3-vendor-notifications-tab-seller"><span>Tab 3: Vendor Notifications (<code>tab=seller</code>)</span></a></h2><p>The <strong>Vendor</strong> tab (labeled <strong>Vendor</strong> in the header navigation, accessed via <code>tab=seller</code>) consolidates seller account updates and customer feedback received by vendors.</p><p><strong>Direct URL</strong>: <code>wp-admin/admin.php?page=wk-marketplace-notifications&amp;tab=seller</code></p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-notifications-vendor-tab.png"><img src="'+g+'" alt="Admin Notifications - Vendor Tab Dashboard"></a></p><h3 id="vendor-notification-formats" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#vendor-notification-formats"><span>Vendor Notification Formats</span></a></h3><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Notification Type</th><th style="text-align:left;">Trigger Event</th><th style="text-align:left;">Display Format</th><th style="text-align:left;">Details Provided</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>New Seller Review</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">A customer submits a review and rating on a vendor shop profile</td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>A new review was received on the &lt;Shop_Name&gt; Profile from &lt;Customer_Name&gt; &lt;X&gt; days ago.</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Identifies the vendor shop that received the feedback and the customer who wrote it.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Vendor Registration / Profile Update</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Vendor registers or updates shop credentials</td><td style="text-align:left;">Alerts informing the administrator of vendor account lifecycle changes.</td><td style="text-align:left;">Helps admin verify seller compliance and KYC documentation.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Empty State</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">No vendor events are logged in the database</td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>No data Found</code></td><td style="text-align:left;">Displayed automatically when no seller records match the query.</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="pagination-display-configuration" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#pagination-display-configuration"><span>Pagination &amp; Display Configuration</span></a></h2><p>The Admin Notifications list table includes a built-in pagination control at the bottom of the feed:</p><ul><li><strong>Pagination URL Parameter</strong>: <code>n-page=&lt;number&gt;</code> (e.g., <code>admin.php?page=wk-marketplace-notifications&amp;n-page=2</code>).</li><li><strong>Items Per Page</strong>: The number of notifications displayed per page is controlled by the standard WordPress setting: <ul><li>Navigate to <strong>Settings &gt; Reading</strong> in your WordPress dashboard.</li><li>Locate <strong>Blog pages show at most</strong>.</li><li>Update the numeric value (default is <code>10</code> items).</li></ul></li></ul><hr><h2 id="admin-vs-vendor-notification-comparison" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#admin-vs-vendor-notification-comparison"><span>Admin vs. Vendor Notification Comparison</span></a></h2><p>The WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace distinguishes between the administrative notification center and the seller dashboard notification area:</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Feature Dimension</th><th style="text-align:left;">Admin Notification Center</th><th style="text-align:left;">Vendor / Seller Notification Area</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Access Location</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">WordPress Admin (<code>Marketplace &gt; Notifications</code>)</td><td style="text-align:left;">Front-end Vendor Dashboard or Separate Vendor Backend (<code>/seller/notifications/</code>)</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Visibility Scope</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Global</strong>: Oversees all vendors, all orders, all customer reviews, and all catalog items marketplace-wide.</td><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Restricted</strong>: Only displays notifications where <code>author_id</code> matches the logged-in seller.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Read Status Tracking</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Acts as an immutable historical activity log; records remain visible for auditing.</td><td style="text-align:left;">Includes read/unread tracking (<code>read_flag = 0</code> vs <code>1</code>) with unread badge counters.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Action Drilldowns</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Links to native WordPress/WooCommerce admin post editor screens (<code>wp-admin/post.php?post=&lt;ID&gt;&amp;action=edit</code>).</td><td style="text-align:left;">Links to vendor-facing order views and vendor product management screens.</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><p>This system ensures the admin stays updated on all <strong>critical marketplace events</strong> and can manage operations efficiently.</p>',62)]))}]]),m=JSON.parse('{"path":"/documentation/admin-notifications.html","title":"Admin Notifications","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{"title":"Admin Notifications","description":"Complete administrator guide for managing marketplace notifications in WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace. Monitor orders, product approvals, stock alerts, and vendor reviews with real-time status tracking and filtering.","head":[["meta",{"name":"keywords","content":"woocommerce marketplace admin notifications, admin notification area, marketplace notifications guide, admin order notifications, vendor notifications woocommerce, product approval notification, multi vendor notifications filter"}],["meta",{"property":"og:title","content":"Admin Notifications | WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace"}],["meta",{"property":"og:description","content":"Complete administrator guide for managing marketplace notifications in WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace. Monitor orders, product approvals, stock alerts, and vendor reviews with real-time status tracking and filtering."}],["meta",{"property":"og:type","content":"article"}]]},"headers":[{"level":2,"title":"Admin Access & Navigation","slug":"admin-access-navigation","link":"#admin-access-navigation","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Admin Notification Overview","slug":"admin-notification-overview","link":"#admin-notification-overview","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Notification Area","slug":"notification-area","link":"#notification-area","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Administrative Interface Structure","slug":"administrative-interface-structure","link":"#administrative-interface-structure","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Types of Notifications","slug":"types-of-notifications","link":"#types-of-notifications","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Tab 1: Orders Notifications (tab=orders)","slug":"tab-1-orders-notifications-tab-orders","link":"#tab-1-orders-notifications-tab-orders","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Sub-Filter Sections","slug":"sub-filter-sections","link":"#sub-filter-sections","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Order Notification Message Formats","slug":"order-notification-message-formats","link":"#order-notification-message-formats","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Tab 2: Product Notifications (tab=product)","slug":"tab-2-product-notifications-tab-product","link":"#tab-2-product-notifications-tab-product","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Product Notification Formats","slug":"product-notification-formats","link":"#product-notification-formats","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Tab 3: Vendor Notifications (tab=seller)","slug":"tab-3-vendor-notifications-tab-seller","link":"#tab-3-vendor-notifications-tab-seller","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Vendor Notification Formats","slug":"vendor-notification-formats","link":"#vendor-notification-formats","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Pagination & Display Configuration","slug":"pagination-display-configuration","link":"#pagination-display-configuration","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Admin vs. Vendor Notification Comparison","slug":"admin-vs-vendor-notification-comparison","link":"#admin-vs-vendor-notification-comparison","children":[]}],"git":{},"filePathRelative":"documentation/admin-notifications.md"}')}}]);